| 6 | 35–40s | **Neat Bot returns.** The "nl" tile from the intro bursts back into dots, which reassemble into the Neat Bot hero tile. A status chip reads "Reading traces…". | Meet Neat Bot. |
| 7 | 40–50s | **Employee vs Admin** split screen with the same question on both sides. Left (Employee): own traces only; attempting another user’s trace shows the exact ownership refusal; project tools are unavailable. Right (Admin): all traces, analytics, detections and triage, and a triage change still shows an Approve card. *(motion graphics: stylized app panels rebuilt in Remotion, using the real tool names and the real refusal message from src/mastra/tools/neatlogs.ts; no new captures)* | Employees: own runs. Admins: every user. |
